Ultimate Weapon Plus:
Smite gives every Chain Lightning hit a chance equal to Chain Lightning Chance to do extra damage equal to a multiple of current wave HP. Smite activates up to 100 times per enemy.
Ultimate Weapon Plus abilities can only be unlocked once all 9 Ultimate Weapons are purchased.
Formula: Uses the global Ultimate Weapon damage formula with Chain Lightning Damage as the UW multiplier.
Behavior:
Base stats: Damage x2 to x7,961, Quantity 1 to 5, Chance 5.0% to 27.5%.
Labs: Chain Lightning Shock unlocks at Tier 7 Wave 60, then unlocks Shock Chance and Shock Multiplier. Later labs add enemy damage reduction scaling from Chain Lightning damage and extra consecutive-hit damage against scatters.
Chain Lightning Shock: Chance to apply shock to enemies hit by Chain Lightning, causing enemies to receive more damage. Has 1 level. Chance starts at 2.50% and the multiplier starts at x1.10.
Shock Chance: Chance Chain Lightning applies shock to enemies. Has 30 levels.
Shock Multiplier: Extra damage enemies affected by shock receive. Has 14 levels.
Enemy Damage Reduction Lab: Enemy damage is reduced by 10% for every 6% of health an enemy lost from Chain Lightning damage, up to a max percent. Has 30 levels increasing max reduction by 3% per level for a max reduction of 90%.
Scatter Consecutive-Hit Lab: Increases Chain Lightning damage done to scatters by each consecutive hit as an additive bonus, so all values are effectively 1+ higher than shown compared with the original 1x first hit.
Cards: Ultimate Crit applies because Chain Lightning damage scales from tower damage rather than % enemy health.
Masteries: None.
Modules:
Core module substats: Damage Common +8x, Rare +15x, Epic +25x, Legendary +50x, Mythic +100x, Ancestral +250x. Quantity Epic +1, Legendary +2, Mythic +3, Ancestral +4. Chance Common +2%, Rare +4%, Epic +6%, Legendary +9%, Mythic +12%, Ancestral +15%.
Unique modules: Dimension Core. Epic: Chain Lightning shock can stack up to 5, and Chain Lightning has a 60% chance to hit the initial target. Legendary: stack cap 10. Mythic: stack cap 15. Ancestral: stack cap 20. Shock chance and multiplier are doubled.
Perks: Unlock a Random Ultimate Weapon can grant a semi-upgraded Chain Lightning for the run; module substats still apply, but Chain Lightning labs stay locked. Chain Lightning Damage x2 doubles Chain Lightning damage. The weapon-specific perk only appears when Chain Lightning is already unlocked or was granted by the random-UW perk that run.
