Mechanic: Golden Tower
Type: Ultimate Weapon
Domain: Workshop
Section: Ultimate Weapons
Category: Cash & Coin Multiplier
Aliases: gt
Disambiguation: This entry is about Golden Tower as an individual Ultimate Weapon, not the Ultimate Weapons system as a whole, another weapon, or the Golden Combo UW+ row in isolation.
Definition: Golden Tower turns the tower golden for a period of time after a cooldown. While active, it provides a multiplier to cash and coins earned from enemy kills. Golden Tower does not deal damage; it modifies income.
Basic Upgrades:
Basic upgrades for Golden Tower are located in the Ultimate Weapon menu after unlocking the Ultimate Weapon. Unlocking Golden Tower allows the player to upgrade Multiplier, Duration, and Cooldown using stones.
Upgradeable stats:
• Multiplier
• Duration
• Cooldown
Costs:
Multiplier has 20 levels, Duration has 38 levels, and Cooldown has 20 levels.
Total stone cost is 27,186.
Ultimate Weapon Plus:
Golden Combo increases cash and coins earned after Golden Tower finishes by x% for each kill.
Ultimate Weapon Plus abilities can only be unlocked when all 9 Ultimate Weapons are unlocked.
Formula:
Bonus multiplier = ((1 + 0.0003 x (Level + 1))^Kill) - 1
Golden Combo only counts kills from enemies that spawned during the current Golden Tower activation. Enemies alive before activation do not count.
Behavior:
Final bonus depends heavily on Golden Tower duration.
K = kills during GT = kills per second * duration = Kps * d
B = bonus multiplier = ((1 + 0.0003 x (Level + 1))^K) - 1
I = income during GT = K * income per mob
T = number of GT activations = total duration / GT CD
Final income: T * I * (1 + B)
100% GT Uptime:
If GT is already at 100% uptime (such as when using MVN or GC), the calculation changes a bit.

T = Number of GT activations = Total duration / d

FI = Final income =T * (I + I * B) => T * I * (1 + B) => Total duration * Kps * income per mob * ((1 + 0.0003 x (Level + 1))^(Kps * d))
Labs:
Unlocks labs in Milestones at Tier 4 Wave 200, unlocking Golden Tower Bonus and Golden Tower Duration. Each lab increases the base level of its respective workshop stat.

Golden Tower Bonus
Has 25 levels, with each level increasing the Golden Tower bonus by 0.15, for a total additional bonus of 3.75.

Golden Tower Duration
Has 20 levels, each increasing the duration of Golden Tower, for a total duration increase of 20s.

