Base stats: Size 30m to 70m, Duration 15s to 38s, Cooldown 200s to 50s.
Undocumented, unlocking Consume also increases the speed of the pull from Black Hole toward the center.
Labs: Black Hole Damage and Black Hole Coin Bonus unlock at Tier 5 Wave 150. Extra Black Hole unlocks at Tier 5 Wave 500. Black Hole Disable Ranged Enemies unlocks at Tier 14 Wave 20.
Black Hole Damage: Black Hole deals a percent of enemy total health per second. Protectors do not reduce damage from Black Hole. Has 10 levels.
Black Hole Coin Bonus: Extra coins are earned by enemies killed within Black Hole. Enemies do not need to be killed by Black Hole to receive this bonus, nor do they need to be affected by its pull.
Extra Black Hole: A second Black Hole spawns when Black Hole is active. The second Black Hole always spawns on the opposite side of the tower and has the same stats and abilities as the original Black Hole.
Black Hole Disable Ranged Enemies: Ranged enemies inside Black Holes cannot fire even when in range. Unlocks at Tier 14 Wave 20.
Cards: Ultimate Crit does not apply to Black Hole's % based damage lab ticks.
Masteries: None.
Modules:
Core module substats: Size Common +2m, Rare +4m, Epic +6m, Legendary +8m, Mythic +10m, Ancestral +12m. Duration Legendary +2s, Mythic +3s, Ancestral +4s. Cooldown Legendary -2s, Mythic -3s, Ancestral -4s.
Unique modules: Primordial Collapse. Epic: spawns one extra Black Hole and reduces damage from enemies within a Black Hole by 50%. Legendary: 55%. Mythic: 65%. Ancestral: 80%.
Perks: Unlock a Random Ultimate Weapon can grant a semi-upgraded Black Hole for the run; module substats still apply, but Black Hole labs stay locked. Black Hole Duration +12.0s adds 12 seconds to Black Hole duration. The weapon-specific perk only appears when Black Hole is already unlocked or was granted by the random-UW perk that run.
Interactions: Black Hole distance from the tower depends on Tower Range, and the center of the hole moves farther from the tower as range increases. Multiverse Nexus synchronizes Black Hole with Death Wave and Golden Tower using the averaged shared cooldown. Galaxy Compressor also reduces Black Hole cooldown by 10s, 13s, 17s, and 20s on package pickup at Epic, Legendary, Mythic, and Ancestral. Global Ultimate Damage relics provide up to +35% total UW damage for UWs that deal damage. Power Vault provides four separate 5% Ultimate Weapon Damage nodes for +20% total global UW damage.
Footguns: None.

Mechanic: Spotlight
Type: Ultimate Weapon
Domain: Workshop
Section: Ultimate Weapons
Category: Damage Amplifier
Aliases: sl
Disambiguation: This entry is about Spotlight as an individual Ultimate Weapon, not the Ultimate Weapons system as a whole, another weapon, or the Light Range UW+ row in isolation.
Definition: Spotlight creates rotating light cones that increase damage taken by enemies inside the beam. It multiplies non-%-health damage sources rather than acting as its own damage hit.
Basic Upgrades:
Basic upgrades for Spotlight are located in the Ultimate Weapon menu after unlocking the Ultimate Weapon. Unlocking Spotlight allows the player to upgrade Bonus, Angle, and Quantity using stones.
Upgradeable stats:
• Bonus
• Angle
• Quantity
Costs:
Bonus has 25 levels.
Angle has 60 levels.
Quantity has 3 levels.
Total stone cost is 42,236.
Ultimate Weapon Plus:
Light Range boosts Spotlight damage bonus.
Ultimate Weapon Plus abilities can only be unlocked when all 9 Ultimate Weapons have been purchased.
Formula: None. Spotlight is a damage-taken multiplier, not a standalone direct-damage formula.
Behavior:
Base stats: Bonus x8.0 to x43.0, Angle 30 to 90, Quantity 1 to 4.
Spotlight multiplies all damage sources that are not based on % enemy health and are not based on wave stats.
Labs: Spotlight Missiles unlocks at Tier 3 Wave 400. Spotlight Coin Bonus unlocks at Tier 7 Wave 80.
Spotlight Missiles: The tower fires missiles from the tower after a period of time. Spotlight Missiles will not fire until the first level is unlocked and frequency becomes 19 seconds. Has 18 levels.
Spotlight Coin Bonus: Provides a coin multiplier to enemies killed in Spotlight. They do not need to be killed by Spotlight.
Cards: None.
Masteries: None.
Modules:
Core module substats: Bonus Common +1.2x, Rare +2.5x, Epic +3.5x, Legendary +10x, Mythic +15x, Ancestral +20x. Angle Epic +3 degrees, Legendary +6 degrees, Mythic +11 degrees, Ancestral +15 degrees.
Unique modules: Om Chip. Epic: Spotlight rotates to focus bosses and reflected light increases nearby-enemy damage taken by x2. Legendary: x4. Mythic: x7. Ancestral: x15.
Perks: Unlock a Random Ultimate Weapon can grant a semi-upgraded Spotlight for the run; module substats still apply, but Spotlight labs stay locked. Spotlight Damage Bonus x1.5 multiplies Spotlight's damage-taken bonus by 1.5x. The weapon-specific perk only appears when Spotlight is already unlocked or was granted by the random-UW perk that run.
Interactions: Light Range boosts Spotlight damage bonus by a percent of Damage / Meter, and Tower Range affects that behavior. Spotlight Missiles uses Smart Missiles damage; when Smart Missiles is not unlocked, Spotlight Missiles uses the base damage of 14x instead. Global Ultimate Damage relics provide up to +35% total UW damage for UWs that deal damage, and Power Vault provides four separate 5% Ultimate Weapon Damage nodes for +20% total global UW damage.
Footguns: Current Core substat data modifies Bonus and Angle only; Quantity is not currently exposed as a Core substat.